# Cloudflare Pages reads this file. Path rules only, first match wins, so the
# most specific rule has to come first.
#
# Domain level redirects (www to apex, pages.dev to apex) cannot be done here.
# They need a Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard. See AUTOMATION.md.
#
# No SPA fallback line is needed: Cloudflare Pages already serves index.html
# for any path that is not a real file.

# The old Georges Barbers section of this site moved to its own domain.
# Search Console reported these as Soft 404s in September 2026.
#
# Blog posts keep their slug, so each old address lands on its own post rather
# than the homepage. Both targets were checked: they render their own title,
# h1 and about 1,850 words, and both are in georgesbarbers.co.uk/sitemap.xml.
/georges-barbers/blog/*  https://georgesbarbers.co.uk/blog/:splat  301
/georges-barbers         https://georgesbarbers.co.uk              301
/georges-barbers/*       https://georgesbarbers.co.uk              301

# Old contact address, still linked from elsewhere. Applies to the apex and to
# www, because both are served by this same Pages project.
/contact-us              /contact                                  301
